[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835392527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105841#issuecomment-2835392527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105841","id":2835392527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pAKgP","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T14:11:59Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T14:11:59Z","body":"Looks like the correct behavior given the scene's structure.\n\nThe `CanvasLayer` node is a separate layer from the main scene, it doesn't move with the camera. The mouse is always in the same position from the point of the view the `Control` node when the camera moves the main scene so new mouse events aren't emitted or propagated.\n\nTo fix it you can set the control's `mouse_filter` is set to ignore. It stops handling inputs so they are processed by the other nodes instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835392527/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898022168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105841#issuecomment-2898022168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105841","id":2898022168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6svE8Y","user":{"login":"Auseawesome","id":70506988,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNTA2OTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70506988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome","html_url":"https://github.com/Auseawesome","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T13:42:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T13:42:46Z","body":"Can confirm in v4.4.1 stable.\n\n[area2d-enter-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20369105/area2d-enter-test.zip)\n\nSimpler MRP ^\n\nMoving the control outside the canvas layer or removing the control allow the mouse entered/exited to be called on camera movement. This cannot be intended behaviour because it is correctly called when mouse moves but not when the camera moves, the input is being handled by the area2d not the control.\n\nIn my actual project this is a serious issue because it means selecting objects in game is incredibly bugged when the camera moves.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898022168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898026359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105841#issuecomment-2898026359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105841","id":2898026359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6svF93","user":{"login":"Auseawesome","id":70506988,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNTA2OTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70506988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome","html_url":"https://github.com/Auseawesome","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auseawesome/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T13:44:10Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T13:44:10Z","body":"> To fix it you can set the control's `mouse_filter` is set to ignore. It stops handling inputs so they are processed by the other nodes instead.\n\nIf input needs to be processed by this node, which often it would be, setting it to pass should have the same behaviour as ignore","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898026359/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]